# Every file the production relay image is built from, one repo path per line.
# changed-tiers.sh redeploys the relay only when one of these differs from the
# commit production runs; a change anywhere else under bridge/ is checked but
# never rolls the relay, whose Recreate drops every WebSocket.
#
# The Rust sources are the relay bin and the bridge-crate modules it reaches.
# bridge/tests/relay_sources.rs derives that set from the code and fails when
# this list does not match it exactly, so a new `use crate::…` in the relay
# path cannot slip past the deploy filter.
#
# Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock count whole: a dependency bump may be one the
# relay links. vendor/ is not listed — the relay reaches no webrtc code.
bridge/src/bin/relay.rs
bridge/src/lib.rs
bridge/src/relay_server.rs
bridge/src/transport.rs
bridge/Cargo.toml
bridge/Cargo.lock
bridge/Containerfile
bridge/.dockerignore
deploy/k8s/relay.yaml
